    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b18406746efc5b988b02d5e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在看了《月刊闪耀》上的那篇采访报道，\n以及两位共同出演的电视节目之后，\n我产生了一种强烈的预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9b608b4ed088e1f45b66ed0ef18e09b1bc73d0f6babb54be7c057d3df7db9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ea9f7d354d5151f9afe246",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目导演",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a4303507c209e01942c7d6c23441711c7616e6ef1021a5b3242992c58e8965",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03768415861143bc0375846",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大多数赛马娘，为了赢得荣冠\n怀揣着远大的梦想，这自然是理所应当的，\n但是在大家之中——",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a86f5555d2a261e5c1b5b7c3f8071f4aeb2f12b1c6bcf6549e1112a8c4a600",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617cdd9e0f2d3c7bec873775",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目导演",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a4303507c209e01942c7d6c23441711c7616e6ef1021a5b3242992c58e8965",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a262fd8657bd9b9e0803e2fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论何时、无论何地，您的梦想的根基，\n似乎仅仅是因为训练员一个人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b40136228b974961952fa9b673f082d67fff025018131a8aaf091d7b06f52d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8bc5af83e300a5f5d51d75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目导演",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a4303507c209e01942c7d6c23441711c7616e6ef1021a5b3242992c58e8965",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4653417114f20052f365ada",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们的纪录片，主题正是赛马娘与\n训练员之间深厚的羁绊。\n所以，两位可以说是再合适不过的人选了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bde13343116bb52e9110b40e44f41b8f03bd355db729a5588631b6495100010",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70926f44b6cb6b7e05b9883",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拍摄日程也是在不影响我们日常训练\n和赛事的范围内安排的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c6350b048046dce85c0703b7dd75a3fab2d1e9817f6901880a784bf77515fd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a28bd5c32817e2d9f5c06b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这个时期，如果能增加曝光率，\n将她的存在更广泛地传达给世人的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec5df6f70f2579312542bf6ade7c175bb42fd6b731a9d78196f67cb4a245ae6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f67d58848f14b689559dc33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要不会给她带来压力，\n我就非常愿意接受——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5279db77343f85fe4f2820fd992da41c91eaef3760e5378a90d8e4a1361ea4f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aebe6dab3f40b4c736c85557",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
