    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5088c31c1ee36e509f37e95e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在正是杜鹃花和紫阳花盛开的时节呢。\n所以，我很开心——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a51d1d57105f770ed1c01c566bbddec58a4abd935ddf0de486efb5398f40b000",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c522f90161acbdd9eadd1243",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，在训练的间隙，\n我们开始了被跟拍采访的每一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6edeb312d22f2de3ad37e02a6bda1fa9e3474c5544eb089b6b307a0d09347cd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
