    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b866e131db68843c551e96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "节目助理导演",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f38f902c8397205f30b7025bda54f5d20d6f47d32c18c74149794692a1f491",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134206.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd060c85bfec5951a0b73b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摄像机基本上是一直开着的。\n可能一开始会有些不习惯，\n但还请两位像平时一样自然地度过就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "590e42dfd3ef1d0e94b75a2dd3d864c92c6410c089b2169774647902e82ae20c",
